Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:52.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约市 联合国）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:22.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,由联合国秘书长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was so ably pointed out by the secretary general…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在揭幕演说中提出\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in his opening remarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…我必须强调\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… and I must emphasize this point…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有公式能涵盖所有案例\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no formula can or will ever cover each case.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,举例来说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当有三个或更多申请人被认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}When three or more applicants have been recognized…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.05,0:01:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就会直接引起冲突…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is in direct contradiction to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:08.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新奥尔良 路易斯安那）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:13.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灵魂之最）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的丧礼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose funeral is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:08.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加勒比海的圣莫尼克岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:34.72,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之生死关头》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概你还没结婚吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not married by any chance, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 失眠了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insomnia, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,下指示了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时间不多了 我一面解释 你一面整理行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't much time. I'll explain as you pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,整理什么行李 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去24小时 我们有三位干员被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of our agents were killed during the last 24 hours:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约的桃尔 新奥尔良的汉米顿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawes in New York, HamiIton in New Orleans…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,加勒比海的班恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Baines in the Caribbean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.73,0:08:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,班恩 我蛮喜欢班恩 我们去同一家鞋店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baines. I rather liked Baines. We shared the same boot maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝咖啡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这些谋杀案互有关连\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it these killings are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是要你查个水落石出\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's precisely what you're going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,班恩在加勒比海圣莫尼克的小岛工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baines was working on a small island in the Caribbean called San Monique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃尔在纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawes was in New York…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边监视它的首相：康乃克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}…keeping an eye on its prime minister, one Dr. kananga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉米被美国人借到新奥尔良\N{\fnArial\fs30}HamiIton was on loan to the Americans in New Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的功用就这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我应该要恭喜你才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, congratulations seem to be in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,意大利人对你处理罗马事件印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Italians were most impressed by the way you handled the Rome affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生 要加糖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir. Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:09:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地官员可帮了大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The authorities were more than helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一点美中不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one small complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们似乎有一名干员失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem to be missing one of their agents…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个小姐 嗯 叫可鲁索\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a Miss Caruso.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概不知道她在哪吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't happen to know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 钱班霓小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Miss Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 钱班霓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 先生 - 来的时间真是不巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, sir. - Certainly the hour that's indecent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？我这有你去纽约的机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I've got your ticket to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q也修好你的手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q has repaired your wristwatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些圣莫尼克的背景资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some background material on San Monique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 钱班霓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信负担沉重的英国纳税人 一定好奇地要知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the overburdened British taxpayer will be fascinated to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别处理小组如何运用它的基金\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how the Special Ordnance Section disburses its funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后 队长我建议你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln future, Commander, allow me to suggest…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,街上不远就有个很棒的钟表匠\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a perfectly adequate watchmaker just down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 把这个按钮拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}By pulling out this button, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:11:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表就产生强力电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it turns the watch into a hyperintensified magnetic field…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量强到能让一颗子弹转向\N{\fnArial\fs30}…powerful enough to even deflect the path of a bullet…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q说至少长射程是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at long range, or so Q claims.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想现在就试试这个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel very tempted to test that theory right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 若你不介意 请还我汤匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind, Commander, my spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克博士目前在纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. kananga is, at present, in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经通知中情局 他们答应协助监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ClA have been informed, and they're helping with the surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的班机上午11点30分到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your flight arrives at 11:30 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把外套放到哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where did I leave my coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 让我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 钱班霓 一起走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Come along, Miss Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 邦德长官 - 再见 钱班霓小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Bond. - Sir. Miss Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.23,0:11:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我该说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「再见 朋友」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}… "Ciao, bello?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此优雅的触摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a delicate touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯粹是磁性 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheer magnetism, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个男人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他速度很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}He traveIs quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有备而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跨洋越海\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes over water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟其他人一起旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He traveIs with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will oppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带来暴力与毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brings violence and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 莱特先生找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Mr. Leiter for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 菲力 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Hello, Felix. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不塞车的话 我半小时就能到你那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traffic permitting, I should be with you in about haIf an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时 你就能请我吃纽约最好的午餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can buy me the best lunch in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 詹姆斯 你朋友康乃克刚离开联合国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, James. Your friend kananga has just left the U.N.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能回使馆去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably headed back to his embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 那地方已经受到严密监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't worry. I've got the place eyeballed, wired for sound, the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 半小时后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I'll see you in a haIf hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开慢点 查理 要安全到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, Charlie. Let's get there in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 一切就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克的轿车来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes kananga's limousine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出来了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out he gets…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,带著以前的班底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with the usual goon squad…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间 11点46分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time, 11:46.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 菲力？你知道我多不喜欢麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Felix? You know how I hate to trouble you…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我碰到点小困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I've run into a little bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.57,0:16:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的司机死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your driver is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我追查一辆白色大轿车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a make on a white pimpmobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,347NDG的牌照\N{\fnArial\fs30}347 NeIson-David-George.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克博士 看来这次会议还没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would seem, Dr. Kananga, that the conference has not lived up…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,达到你事前的期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to your prior expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望这仅仅是短暂的挫败\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can only hope that this is a temporary setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我还要观察一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I do have some observations to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你写封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a letter, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:17:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,给岛屿协商潘秘书长\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Secretary General, Pan Island Unity Conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I wish to point out…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,指出\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们太多的邻国\N{\fnArial\fs30}…too many of our island neighbors…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have once again let themselves be…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国工业愚弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bullied by United States industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史是老的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story is an old one…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录是明确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the record a clear one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从六个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since my historic statement of principles…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行了我历史性的宣告\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was delivered and acted upon some six months ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的经济展望 有很戏剧性的改善\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our economic outlook has improved dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在运用了我们一贯公平对待的友善政策后\N{\fnArial\fs30}By exercising our policy of friendship to all with favoritism towards none…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个地区有了新的面貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}…new respect for the entire area has been engendered…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我一些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and even though some of my most…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 车主登记住址在 38街和65街交界的一家店\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, that car is registered to a shop at 33 East 65th Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里只有一个街口 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's only a block away from here. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 老兄 康乃克在那里高谈阔论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time, buddy. kananga's knitting a flag in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.69,0:17:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许最简单的方法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be the easiest thing to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:00.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（异教邪术商店）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便看看 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just browsing. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,五圆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我包起来好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you could gift-wrap it for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:19:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意 整个包起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lengthwise, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍是我主要关心的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remains my first concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 圣莫尼克岛和其邻近岛国未来责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, San Monique's future obligations vis-a-vis her island neighbors…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是非常明显了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would seem clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在激怒时求饶的国家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who fawn and crawl in the face of intimidation…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该被强迫向那些有极度的信心而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…must perforce to look up to those who stand proudly…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,屹立不摇的国家看齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wrapped in a justifiable seIf-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机已到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time has come…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,从联盟国家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}…painful as it may be…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to gaze out among our sister nations in the area…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,若有任何…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and see if any…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.32,0:20:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's tailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要上哪去？- 市中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you know where you going, man? - Uptown, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,市中心？你要去哈林区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uptown? You headed into Harlem, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要跟紧那部车 我多给你20元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep on the tail of that jukebox and there's an extra 20 in it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了20元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, for 20 bucks…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.33,0:21:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意带你去3K党的老窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'll take you to a klu klux klan cookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.45,0:21:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,125号车 有辆车跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}125th, you got a honky on your tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:21:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向东驶去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading east.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会追丢 好像跟踪棒球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't miss him. It's like following a cue ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那辆车 他们一定进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the car. They must have gone inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.34,0:22:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up where you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能很容易就交到些朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure hope you make friends easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.65,0:22:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要走进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.85,0:22:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安 我要波本酒加水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon. Bourbon and water, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.32,0:22:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个位子就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First booth will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉他不加冰块 好吗？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell him neat, would you? - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要冰块 - 那要多加钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No ice. - That's extra, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要其他一些消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like something on the side as well information.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.35,0:23:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,三男一女刚走进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three men and a girl came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.99,0:23:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松点 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大等下会招呼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Big's gonna take care of you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.88,0:24:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑桃皇后在红心国王旁边 小姐是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black queen on the red king, Miss…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.55,0:24:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沙丽塔 - 我叫邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Solitaire. - My name's Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.06,0:24:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 你的身份和来此的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are, what you are and why you've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.90,0:24:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯了个错误 你不会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have made a mistake. You will not succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.54,0:24:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们素昧平生的情况下 这说法令人感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather a sweeping statement, considering we've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.51,0:24:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,纸牌替我跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cards have followed you for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.34,0:24:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你在底特律遭遇困难 你就说我的名字 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you get ripped off in Detroit, baby, you yell out to me, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.72,0:24:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有带武器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he armed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.12,0:24:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纽约市你不能不特别小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be too careful in New York City these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.08,0:25:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪 这点小事声使他发笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny how the least little thing amuses him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.52,0:25:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.79,0:25:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然的 这张是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you, quite obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.63,0:25:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,高级女祭司 简直一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}An amazing resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.59,0:25:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我也在里面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, am I in there as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,选一张牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.17,0:25:34.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（傻瓜）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.24,0:25:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到你自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have found yourseIf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.14,0:25:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 你去洛杉矶处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, y'all go out there to L.A. and clean it up…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.78,0:25:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我会去处理你！我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or I'm coming out there and clean you up, and I mean that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.72,0:25:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个笨家伙跟踪你进城吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the stupid mother that tailed you uptown?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.22,0:25:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这似乎有点误会 我叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There seems to be some mistake. My name is…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.59,0:25:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把名字留给墓碑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Names is for tombstones, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带家伙出去 把他做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all take this honky out and waste him, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.20,0:26:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「做掉他」？这是好事吗？- 会面结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Waste him"? Is that a good thing? - The reading is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没谈我的将来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about my future?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.67,0:26:07.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（情侣）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.88,0:26:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.02,0:26:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我待在这里 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, promise you'll stay right there. I shan't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.27,0:26:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.48,0:26:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep your hands up, honky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.65,0:26:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为这是什么？我要把他头轰掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he think this is? I'll blow his head off, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.67,0:27:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪放下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.15,0:27:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛史特劳 中情局 我不需要你时 你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold Strutter, ClA. Where were you when I didn't need you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.95,0:27:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你不了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got obvious you weren't coming out front…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.12,0:27:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你穿的衣服 也不是个聪明的伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not even with that clever disguise you're wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.69,0:27:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 哈林区白面孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Er? - Whiteface in Harlem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 邦德 我们离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thinking, Bond. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.30,0:27:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很惊讶 他们没发现你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised they didn't spot you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有一名手上有扑克牌的绝色女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a most remarkable girl back there with a deck of cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.94,0:27:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上去时看到那些牌都是黑桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw those cards on the way up. Spades, James, every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚离开74街就被跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were nailed the minute you left 74th. There's only one man…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.98,0:28:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人不应该取集这么多黑社会力量在这城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who can pull together that much black muscle in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.82,0:28:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自称是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}CalIs himseIf Mr. Big.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说明来意 他们说你欺压黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You name the business, they say he has a black concession.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.66,0:28:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,像康乃克那样的国外总理\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would a foreign prime minister like kananga…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.33,0:28:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要跟美国帮派勾结？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…want with an American gangster?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.43,0:28:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 老大干嘛要和岛屿国家打交道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, what would Mr. Big want with a two-bit island diplomat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.34,0:28:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大？他怎么会牵涉这案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Big? Where the hell does he fit into this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.71,0:28:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准菲力的打火机 真耀眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A genuine Felix lighter. llluminating.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.55,0:28:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.58,0:28:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚发现康乃克有架私人飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just found out that kananga's got a private plane…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.05,0:28:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时内他就要飞到圣莫利克去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he's leaving for San Monique within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.59,0:28:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我安排下一班机好吗？- 我已经安排了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then get me on the next flight. - I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.32,0:28:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会错过机会寻求真正的刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you wouldn't pass a chance to get away from where the real action is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.74,0:29:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 传奇性的男爵圣迷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legendary Baron Samedi, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是沙特蝶 为了说法文的朋友安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Saturday, for those of you who speak French.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.95,0:29:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,公墓的巫毒教魔鬼和死人部落的酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voodoo God of Cemeteries and Chief of the Legion of the Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.78,0:29:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及那位死不了的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Man Who Cannot Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.05,0:29:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的目的 只是为你们这些观众精心安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for our purposes, just a performer in a little musical extravaganza…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.29,0:29:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场狂想的音乐晚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we've cooked up for you wonderful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.77,0:29:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 我叫邦德 有订房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. The name is Bond. You have a reservation for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.77,0:29:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的 邦德太太在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Bond, of course. Mrs. Bond has been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.25,0:29:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德太太？- 她今天下午到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mrs. Bond? - She arrived earlier this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.45,0:29:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说她比较喜欢隐密点的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said she preferred something a little more private.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.65,0:29:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,12号套？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bungalow 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.59,0:29:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德太太真懂得情调\N{\fnArial\fs30}An incurable romantic, Mrs. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.90,0:30:05.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（塔罗牌）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.70,0:31:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room service, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房服务？我是邦德先生 12号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room service? This is Mr. Bond, bungalow 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.51,0:31:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一瓶香槟 微冰就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like a bottle of Bollinger, please. Slightly chilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.35,0:32:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,二个杯子 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two glasses. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.49,0:33:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.70,0:33:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你的香槟送来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your champagne, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.10,0:33:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你的香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - Your champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.37,0:33:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在桌上 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it on the table. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我开吗？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall I open it? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.45,0:33:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我来 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can manage. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.28,0:33:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这给你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you are. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.01,0:35:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你是邦德太太？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Bond, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.61,0:35:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗丝卡佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rosie Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.95,0:35:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I have a little explaining to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.39,0:35:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Either you or…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.46,0:35:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是菲力叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dear Uncle Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.10,0:35:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,点38口径 史密斯威森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Custom.38 Smith and Wesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.07,0:35:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,匣式给弹 没有枪枝标准号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corrugated three-inch stock. No serial number.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.40,0:35:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准中情局配备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard ClA issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.90,0:35:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 为何拿枪指着我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, why point it at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.14,0:35:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,送香槟的人不是旅馆服务生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who delivered your champagne is not a hotel waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.48,0:35:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是要小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.25,0:36:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,关於菲力莱特 你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for Felix Leiter, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.58,0:36:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这替中情局工作有段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've worked for ClA here for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.82,0:36:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打电报说你要来 要求我协助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cabled me you were coming and asked if I wouldn't help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.82,0:36:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你愿意先从头开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd better start by getting your head together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.43,0:36:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 浴室有面镜子 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a mirror in the bathroom. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.70,0:36:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是我第二个任务 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're only my second mission, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.43,0:36:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一个任务是协助被刺杀的班恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first was Baines, the agent who was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.27,0:36:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真庆幸 在你同样协助名单中我是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a relief to know I'm next in line for the same kind of aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.88,0:36:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.62,0:36:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条蛇 我忘记告诉你 进去时不要忘记带鼬鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}A snake. I should have told you. Never go in there without a mongoose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.06,0:36:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就知道 我不该牵连进来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have never gotten into any of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.39,0:36:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你将会是毫无用处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be completely useless to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.43,0:36:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你很快会回复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we'll be able to lick you into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.80,0:36:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很晚了 邦德太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting late, Mrs. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.14,0:36:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们会很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow is going to be a very busy day for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.71,0:37:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克在保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}kananga is protecting something down here…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.94,0:37:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,班恩已经发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…something which…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.54,0:37:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,某样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Baines obviously discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.15,0:37:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉我 班恩尸体在哪找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to show me the spot where Baines' body was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.15,0:37:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕只有今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, I'm afraid, only leaves us tonight to…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.75,0:37:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能重温旧时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}…well, catch up on old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.69,0:37:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力告诉我 会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix told me there'd be moments like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.73,0:37:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,老好人菲力怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did good old Felix suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.63,0:37:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,若都失败了 还有毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}If all eIse failed, cyanide pilIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.47,0:37:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我安排了两个卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I settled for two bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.51,0:37:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.08,0:37:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.06,0:37:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一顶帽子 属于一个小头的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, it's just a hat, darling, belonging to a small-headed man…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.36,0:37:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,狭义的说 这个人连一只鸡都斗不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of limited means who lost a fight with a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.86,0:38:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是警告 把它甩出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a warning. Get it out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.90,0:38:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.60,0:38:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你今晚别丢下我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me alone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.44,0:38:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, please promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.95,0:38:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 亲爱的 如果你坚持的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, darling, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.08,0:38:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.46,0:38:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.46,0:38:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.23,0:38:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.74,0:38:43.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皇后）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.85,0:38:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好了吗？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you ready yet? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.52,0:39:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得租辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see about organizing a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.36,0:39:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大厅见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.17,0:39:13.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（塔罗牌）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.07,0:39:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里 保证一定有大鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, sir. Guaranteed big fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.64,0:39:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来这里抓大鱼 - 宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Catch big fish, sir. - Hey, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.04,0:39:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 带你的男人来 半天只要20元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here. Bring your man over here. Just $20. HaIf a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.08,0:39:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有热情的女士 我们有冰凉的啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got warm lady. We got cold beer over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.95,0:39:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要抓大鱼吗？这里只有二磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to catch a big fish? It's only two pounds over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.16,0:39:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.06,0:39:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 罗丝 这位看起来很积极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rosie. This one seems eager enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.37,0:39:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我能在哪换衣服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Where can I change?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.58,0:39:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 脱衣服 哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me. Clothes off. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.95,0:40:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.42,0:40:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢转过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.03,0:40:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}k eep your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.93,0:40:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我说的 珊瑚 一个差劲探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was saying, Quarrel, a lousy agent…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.50,0:40:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是自得其乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the compensations speak for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.87,0:40:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝卡佛 见过和我用同一把梳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie Carver, meet the man who shares my hairbrush…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.41,0:41:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,的珊瑚二世\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Quarrel, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.74,0:41:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.08,0:41:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点打死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.18,0:41:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你按下保险栓的话 我可能就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have even killed me if you'd taken off the safety catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.82,0:41:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.59,0:41:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要带我们去班恩被杀的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just let us know when we get to the spot where Baines was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.13,0:41:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在山坡上 越过下个海湾之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up in the hilIs just after we clear the next cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.51,0:41:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊瑚 谁住在那儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Quarrel, who the hell lives up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.15,0:41:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克的女人住的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the house of the kananga woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.92,0:41:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会邪术\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's supposed to have the power of the Obeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.75,0:41:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了他没人敢上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one on the island dare go up there except him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.07,0:42:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.73,0:42:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有暴乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.47,0:42:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在正在接近我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He approaches even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.64,0:42:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆路还是水路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By land or water?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.14,0:42:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,水路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.68,0:42:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经到达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.69,0:42:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 罗丝比我想的还有效率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Rosie's been more efficient than I anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.29,0:42:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个地方能租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a place where we can rustle up a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.30,0:42:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽 勇敢 机智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful, brave, and now resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.57,0:42:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝 你展现了后来居上的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie, you seem to be staging a remarkable comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.90,0:42:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.45,0:42:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it death?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.09,0:43:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 是死亡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, is it death?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.66,0:43:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is death.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.93,0:43:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.17,0:43:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie knows what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.50,0:43:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我不要别人插手 要不留痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I want no bodies this time, no trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.04,0:43:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说班恩在山上遇害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought you said Baines was killed up in the hilIs, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.25,0:43:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那边的山底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up in the hilIs down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.05,0:43:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我们不吃点午餐同时好好讨论一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we have a bite of lunch and discuss it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.46,0:43:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,篮子里有很好吃的面饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an excellent patty in the hamper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.56,0:43:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.40,0:43:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.56,0:43:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.26,0:44:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道找到你对我的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't know what finding you has meant to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.93,0:44:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想像的到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.70,0:44:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道找到这张牌对我的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've no idea what finding this has meant to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.10,0:44:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定知道上下颠倒的皇后牌的意思吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know what the Queen of Cups means in an upside-down position?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.21,0:44:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个邪恶不忠的女人 一个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deceitful, perverse woman, a liar, a cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.04,0:44:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd like some answers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.95,0:44:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.12,0:44:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解 如果我说出来 他们会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand, see. They'll kill me if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.62,0:44:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不说 我也会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll kill you if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.22,0:44:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会 也下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you couldn't. You wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.23,0:44:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过那件事以后就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after what we've just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.23,0:44:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在事前绝不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I certainly wouldn't have killed you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.71,0:45:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前的演技不错 罗丝 现在你差一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to be a convincing act, Rosie. It's wearing a little thin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.15,0:45:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演戏 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an act. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.78,0:45:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,下定决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.41,0:45:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.21,0:45:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.86,0:46:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请解释一下错在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will explain what went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.54,0:46:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到一个女人的干预\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the intervention of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.21,0:46:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女的差点要招供 我们必须要杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl was about to confess. We had to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.34,0:46:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱布置好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trap was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.21,0:46:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁黑在等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tee Hee was waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.12,0:46:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you saw death.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.85,0:46:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是那个女人的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been the girI's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.76,0:46:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不问详细\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do not ask specific questions…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.86,0:46:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能为你对答案的误解负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I cannot be responsible for your misinterpretation of the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.30,0:46:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不停的乱象 让我心神不宁 索丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}These growing signs of impertinence begin to disturb me, Solitaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.87,0:46:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你出生前 发生在你母亲身上一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even as they did with your mother before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.44,0:46:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有法力却失去它 对我一点用也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had the power and lost it, became useless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.94,0:46:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会再犯同样的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not make the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.52,0:46:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德现在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Bond now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.87,0:47:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德现在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Bond now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.58,0:47:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你用这种态度的时候 我看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot see when you are this way with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.15,0:47:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情变得模糊不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things become unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.62,0:47:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这种偶发消失的法力不会成为习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us hope these momentary lapses do not become a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.32,0:47:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的法力是来服侍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your power exists to serve me…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.62,0:47:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我来控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it is mine to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.99,0:47:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到的时候 我决定你是否失去法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}If and when the time comes I decide you are to lose it…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.43,0:47:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会收回它\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I myseIf will take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.37,0:47:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡吧 你让我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solitaire, go to sleep. You have made me angry with you…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.44,0:47:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I have no wish to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.71,0:47:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tee Hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.05,0:49:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把牌放下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down those cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.23,0:49:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个大不敬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a blasphemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.43,0:49:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对看不懂的人毫无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell nothing to those who cannot see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.93,0:49:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的确有其含意 要靠点运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they do. That's a bit of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.14,0:49:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.14,0:49:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,牌说我们会成为恋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cards say we will be lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.24,0:49:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误解它的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.91,0:49:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的 禁止我去做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible, forbidden for me…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.98,0:49:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.58,0:49:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do believe…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.35,0:49:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 真的相信牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I mean, really believe in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.63,0:49:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们从来没骗过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have never lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.46,0:49:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they won't now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.27,0:50:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑一张吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.13,0:50:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早知道答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew the answer before it was given.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.90,0:50:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strangely enough, somehow…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.91,0:50:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so did l.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.94,0:51:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's finally happened…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.81,0:51:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟我妈的遭遇一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just as it did to my mother and…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.28,0:51:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我祖母\N{\fnArial\fs30}…her mother before her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.45,0:51:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.52,0:51:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个活的见证 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're visual proof of that, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.59,0:51:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Cheer up, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.86,0:51:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has to be a first time for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.54,0:51:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 康乃克在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me, where's kananga?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.41,0:51:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot see.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.21,0:52:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 牌 我帮你拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, the cards. I'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.75,0:52:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.72,0:52:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能摆脱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.59,0:52:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll soon be rid of him, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.93,0:52:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.16,0:52:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.90,0:52:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…little bit of information, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.17,0:52:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去法力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.67,0:52:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高僧侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.84,0:52:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,说过王子的太太 不再控制这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The high priestess is wife to the prince no longer of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.18,0:52:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往神秘教堂的精神桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spiritual bridge to the secret church.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.35,0:52:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.49,0:52:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了惩罚我与凡人恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}By compelling me to earthly love…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.22,0:52:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,牌已经收回我的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the cards themselves have taken away my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.26,0:52:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, I have a small confession to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.44,0:52:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, try not to be too upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.74,0:53:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是运气比较好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deck was slightly stacked in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.61,0:53:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.11,0:53:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体上的亵渎是无法弥补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The physical violation cannot be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.38,0:53:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他发现我失去法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he finds out I've lost my power…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.82,0:53:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.56,0:53:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得先找到你才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on. He'll have to find you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,情侣的第一课… 我们之间没有秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovers' lesson number one… we have no secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.93,0:53:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如说 我有艘船在等\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, I have a boat waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.00,0:53:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.44,0:53:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们离开前 我只要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have to know before we leave is…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.17,0:53:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫毒地后面是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what goes on back there in Voodooland.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.28,0:53:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,三男一女过去四天内丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, three men and a girl have been killed in the last four days…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.68,0:53:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提他们企图阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not counting the times they've tried to stop me from discovering…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.65,0:53:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现康乃克在保护什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whatever kananga's protecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.92,0:53:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要上船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do you want to be on that boat or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.69,0:53:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是为他读牌而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply read the cards for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.06,0:53:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没去过那儿 他从没带我去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been there, and he's never taken me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.87,0:54:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never dared to go…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.31,0:54:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我由牌里看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I've looked in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.44,0:54:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边很丰饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen great riches there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.68,0:54:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.52,0:54:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Us, " darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.75,0:54:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.16,0:54:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,情人守则第二课…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovers' lesson number two…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.39,0:54:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,团结一致 只有死亡才能将我们分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}…togetherness till death do us part, or thereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.46,0:54:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开前不要留痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there time before we leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.57,0:54:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第三课？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for lesson number three?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.17,0:54:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.08,0:54:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要穿着衣服上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sense in going off haIf-cocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.79,0:55:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边走 - 你怎么这么肯定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.43,0:55:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,稻草人只是要吓人 你不怕吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}These scarecrows are to scare people away. You're not scared, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.56,0:55:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四课… 跟随稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesson number four… follow the scarecrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.60,0:55:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早 老板 - 早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, boss. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.04,0:55:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sure gonna be a beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.71,0:55:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, a beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.22,0:56:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们向山顶上走去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading for the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.19,0:56:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.83,0:56:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他找到的话 杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he finds it, kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.56,0:57:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.88,0:57:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找不到他们了 他带着那女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost him. He has the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.22,0:57:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在网子下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're somewhere under the nets.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.26,0:58:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不计任何代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}At any cost, any…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.97,0:58:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德一定得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Bond must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.52,0:58:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是25号 我们发现他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit two-five, we have picked them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.17,0:58:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部呼叫25号 逮捕邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base to 25. Arrest Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.90,0:58:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 不准碰那女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I repeat, the girl is not to be touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.84,0:58:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 了解 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Message received and understood. Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.07,0:58:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫所有单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base to all units.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.91,0:58:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 不准碰那女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, the girl is not to be touched.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.71,1:00:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去拿多点水来 - 别挡住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go get some more water. - Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.02,1:00:38.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（矮桥）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.33,1:01:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet mother of pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.57,1:01:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点站 下车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All change. End of the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.77,1:01:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到下面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down below quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.40,1:01:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我来 你去发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. I'll do that. You get us started.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.87,1:01:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是突击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears a bust.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.66,1:01:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 他会找我的 我知道他不会罢手\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.20,1:02:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be looking for me now. I know he'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.37,1:02:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.77,1:02:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫毒地不过是罂栗田而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.94,1:02:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,单纯的海洛因走私而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voodooland was just poppy fields…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.75,1:02:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟菲力联络后 整个案子交给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a simple matter of heroin smuggling.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.25,1:02:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没事了 对了 你想去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have a word with a man named Felix and turn the case over to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.05,1:02:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一个像现在这样的地方都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you and I will be off. By the way, where would you like to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.73,1:02:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,多快能到新奥尔良？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere where we can find one of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.07,1:02:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再四个小时才到圣塔明那\N{\fnArial\fs30}How quickly can we make it to New Orleans?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.51,1:02:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那搭上飞机 明天一早就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa Mina, four hours away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.84,1:02:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,用无线电跟菲力联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can catch a flight and be there in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.28,1:02:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明天在皇家东方旅馆见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get in touch with Felix on the scrambler.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.51,1:02:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦帕比较近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to meet me there tomorrow. Royal Orleans Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.82,1:02:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉米顿在新奥尔良被害之间一定有关连\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tampa is closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.59,1:02:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们载的是件相当珍贵的物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}HamiIton was killed in New Orleans, so there has to be a connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.96,1:03:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他ì会想办法夺回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is a valuable piece of merchandise we're carrying…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.40,1:03:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,新奥尔良 国际机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which, with any luck, they'll want back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.51,1:03:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到皇家东方旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Royal Orleans Hotel, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.69,1:03:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这是往新奥尔良的路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is the way to New Orleans?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.79,1:03:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 真的难倒哈林来的司机 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but it sure beats the hell out of Harlem, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.24,1:03:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！怎么了 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello, Jim! What's happening, baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.01,1:03:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后面放轻松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ease back now, Jim. Relax!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.28,1:03:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Big wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.11,1:04:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在岛上犯了个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a mistake back on that island, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.64,1:04:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走了不属于你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took something that didn't belong to you…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.65,1:04:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿了老大朋友的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you took it from a friend of Mr. Big's.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.32,1:04:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种错误很难弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}That type of mistake is tough to bounce back from.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.62,1:04:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才刚刚抵达 - 今天是你的幸运日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I've only just arrived. - Today is your lucky day, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.42,1:04:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去跳伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going skydiving.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.29,1:04:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一万公尺高看那个湖 风景不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a hell of a view of the lake from 10, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.76,1:04:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的遗憾是无法亲眼目睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only regret is I won't be there to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.24,1:04:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他！我们走！- 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, that's him! Let's go! - Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.06,1:05:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 你… - 贝尔太大 你不是我的教官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. You're, uh… - Mrs. Bell. You're not my instructor?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.66,1:05:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比利克先生到哪去了？- 不舒服 我来上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Mr. Bleeker? - Indisposed. I'll be giving the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.57,1:05:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.14,1:05:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天什么课程？- 我们拭目以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's on for today? - Well, let's just wing it, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.41,1:06:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你转速太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're over-revving.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.62,1:06:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,里诺 慢点！拜托 慢点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leroy, slow down! For Pete's sake, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.29,1:06:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 照那个人说的做！- 我找不到刹车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do what the man say! - I can't find the brake!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.40,1:06:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close those doors!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.57,1:06:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.48,1:06:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.93,1:06:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 唐 不用担心 我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Don. Don't worry. I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.13,1:06:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我待会再和你谈 我要去上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Talk to you later. I gotta go and give a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.07,1:07:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天同一时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same time tomorrow, Mrs. Bell?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.14,1:07:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Bleeker. Yes, sir. Well, I know you just…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.01,1:07:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不能把翅膀黏回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can't glue the wings back on. Now, Mr. Bleeker, I'm sure…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.91,1:07:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利克先生 不要生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's no reason for name-calling.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.28,1:07:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天下午再量其他的 - 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can fit the rest this afternoon. - Right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.55,1:07:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘记开双叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget the double vents.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.62,1:07:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她是你最好的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate she may be… one of your best pupiIs, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.79,1:07:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 有点花俏 我保留其余三条\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do nicely. That's a little frantic. I'll keep the other three.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.33,1:07:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种建议能写给华盛顿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any suggestion of that kind should be forwarded in writing to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.06,1:07:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝尔太大如何？- 在加护病房 她会熬过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is Mrs. Bell? - lntensive care. She'll pull through.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.43,1:07:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生 没人怀疑你的爱国情操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Oh, no, sir, no one's questioning your patriotism.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.74,1:07:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定你是退役军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you're a veteran, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.54,1:07:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力帮我问一下 是否有间灵魂之最餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix, you might find out if there's a Fillet of Soul restaurant in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.74,1:07:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比你快一步 在达克街 史特在监视那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're way ahead of you. It's on Docker Street. Strutter's watching it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.52,1:07:52.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灵魂之最）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.05,1:08:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的场面 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a send-off. This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.37,1:09:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史特在哪？- 一定在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Strutter? - He's gotta be inside somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.47,1:09:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 二位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.31,1:09:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙边有好位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a nice booth over here just against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.45,1:09:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能靠舞台近点的位子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you could find something a little closer to the stage?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.38,1:09:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 位子有何不好？- 我有一次不好的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with a booth? - I once had a nasty turn in a booth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.73,1:09:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波本酒 不加冰块 - 来两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bourbon. No ice, please. - Two Sazeracs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.87,1:09:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的冒险家精神到哪去了？这是新奥尔良 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your sense of adventure, James? This is New Orleans. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.18,1:10:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人叫菲力莱特吗？- 是 我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One of you guys called Felix Leiter? - Yeah. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.78,1:10:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位叫史特的人 有电话找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telephone call for you. Guy called Strutter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.99,1:10:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 等等 我以为哈瑞弄砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. For a minute there, I thought Harry was laying down on the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.66,1:10:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to my…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.26,1:10:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的朋友怎么了？- 你的朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to my friend? - What happened to your friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.63,1:10:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for dropping in, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.37,1:10:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个难搞的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you one tough pig to nail down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.07,1:11:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当我是傻子整我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been picking at me like some kind of maggot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.94,1:11:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先你到哈林区杀了我们一个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}First you go up to Harlem and kill one of the brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.41,1:11:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}That disturbed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.71,1:11:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你又由我朋友康乃克博士手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you go and steal this valuable young lady…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.32,1:11:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走这位珍贵的少妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from my good friend, Dr. kananga.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.22,1:11:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克相信算命那一套 我是说 他气坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, old kananga, he believes in all that card crap. I mean, he's mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.36,1:11:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,持有法律的后盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, possession being nine points of the law…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.93,1:11:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克现在是你的问题了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I would say kananga is your problem now. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.87,1:11:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 若我是你 我会步步为营\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, if I were you, I'd watch my step from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.84,1:11:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就让我自己跟他打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you just let me handle our business with the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.55,1:11:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你 我有自己的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got my own plans for you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.62,1:11:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.69,1:11:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要一个小问题的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's one little question that he wants answers for.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.79,1:11:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你不妨把我送回岛上 让他亲自审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, you'd better ship me back to the island and let him ask in person.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.36,1:11:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不习惯回答多管闲事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in the habit of giving answers to lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.27,1:12:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很幸运你还有 留下一个耳朵听问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You damn lucky you got a ear left to hear the question with…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.30,1:12:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是… 你有乱搞吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is… Did you mess with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.68,1:12:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们三个当事人之间的事 我看见他时自然会跟他说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's between Solitaire and myseIf and kananga. I'll tell him when I see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.32,1:12:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你回答我 不然你看不见日出！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't see the sunlight unless you answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.65,1:12:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你这么怕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea you were so frightened of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.05,1:12:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有没有碰她？- 当我见到康乃克时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you touch her? - When I see kananga.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.79,1:12:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.45,1:12:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite revealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.32,1:12:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克是在上千亩良好的伪装用地种植罂栗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}kananga, poppy grower in thousands of acres of well-camouflaged fields…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.99,1:13:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且受到沙特蝶的巫毒教保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}…protected by the voodoo threat of Baron Samedi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.06,1:13:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于老大 透过灵魂之最餐厅连锁店\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as Mr. Big, distributor and wholesaler…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.27,1:13:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为大盘商和销售商\N{\fnArial\fs30}…through a chain of Fillet of Soul restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.64,1:13:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,销售商？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wholesale?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.41,1:13:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖海洛因赚钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell heroin for money?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.61,1:13:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我确定你只是送给大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies. I'm sure you simply give it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.38,1:13:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.18,1:13:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我打算执行的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's precisely what I intend to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.05,1:13:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上是两吨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two tons of it to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.49,1:13:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当进去一个竞争激烈的场所\N{\fnArial\fs30}When entering into a fiercely competitive field…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.69,1:13:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给个赠品没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one finds it advisable to give away free samples.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.96,1:13:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人 女人 黑人 白人 一律平等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man or woman, black or white. I don't discriminate.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.80,1:13:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,二吨的海洛因外面市价超过10亿美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two tons of heroin with a street value well over a billion dollars…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.93,1:13:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国免费分销？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nationally distributed free?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.51,1:13:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会引起某些家族不满？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should make a certain group of families… …rather angry, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.34,1:13:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不满？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.28,1:13:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, my dear Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.35,1:13:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那逼使他们发疯退出这行业\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it'll drive them out of their minds and, subsequently, out of the business.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.25,1:14:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是杰作 福利政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite ingenious. A sort of junkie's weIfare system.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.29,1:14:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到这国家吸毒的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, merely until the number of addicts in the country…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.96,1:14:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,提高两倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has doubled, shall we say?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.26,1:14:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将会开始推销你那天无意闯入的田地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will begin to market that acreage that you blundered into the other day.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.13,1:14:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洛因将会十分昂贵 让我和电话公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}That heroin will be very expensive… …leaving myseIf and the phone company…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.14,1:14:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后全部垄断\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the only two going monopolies in this nation for years to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.07,1:14:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是索丽塔算的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here I thought it was Solitaire did the fortunetelling.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.18,1:14:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你们两人着想 希望她功力还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope for both of your sakes she still can.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.02,1:14:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题依然存在 由关心人士提出\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question still stands, Mr. Bond, asked by the gentleman concerned.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.06,1:14:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有碰她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you touch her?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.39,1:14:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是绅士回答的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, it's not the sort of question a gentleman answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.43,1:14:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,前车之鉴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, having set the example…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.97,1:14:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信她还是清白之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I don't expect Miss Solitaire to be any less the lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.61,1:14:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.68,1:15:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手表好炫\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that's a particularly handsome watch you're wearing, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.95,1:15:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能不能借我看？- 抱歉 我起不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I see it, please? - You'll forgive me if I don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.76,1:15:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butter hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.47,1:15:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tee Hee…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.91,1:15:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要是回答错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on the first wrong answer from Miss Solitaire…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.28,1:15:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就捏邦德先生的右手小指\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will snip the little finger of Mr. Bond's right hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.35,1:15:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二次回答错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with the second wrong answer…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.46,1:15:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找更重要的部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'll proceed to the more vital areas.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.60,1:15:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solitaire, my dear…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.67,1:15:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仔细听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I want you to listen to me very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.24,1:16:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生手表后面登记的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the back of Mr. Bond's watch, the registration number…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.75,1:16:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…3-2-6-6\N{\fnArial\fs30}…3-2-6-6.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.89,1:16:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I speak the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.54,1:16:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.53,1:17:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.20,1:17:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,若没别的事 你暂时不需要怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If nothing eIse, at least I have laid your fears to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.27,1:17:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恭贺你这么精密的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}My compliments on a splendid operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.81,1:17:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one thing, however, the…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.35,1:17:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他去农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whisper, take him to the farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.72,1:17:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候回去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do we start back?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.29,1:18:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, Solitaire, soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.61,1:18:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solitaire, why?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.98,1:18:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你这么好 你什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I treated you well. You lacked for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.45,1:18:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不了解你说… - 邦德先生的手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand what you… - Mr. Bond's watch, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.09,1:18:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你我最大的宽容 你有5成的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you every break possible. You had a 50-50 chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.49,1:18:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't even close.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.20,1:18:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.23,1:18:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请相信我 这些牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please believe me. The cards.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.62,1:19:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机成熟时 我会给你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the time came, I myseIf would have given you love.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.76,1:19:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew that. You knew that!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.27,1:19:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理这件事只有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one proper way to deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.44,1:19:21.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（死亡）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.84,1:19:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机成熟时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one proper time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.92,1:19:35.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（入侵者会被吃掉）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.91,1:20:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验快要成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tonnage order is nearly complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.75,1:20:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚动身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move it out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.96,1:20:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.66,1:20:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.81,1:21:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对鳄鱼了解多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you know about crocodiles, Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.71,1:21:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我始终跟他们保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've always tried to keep them at arm's length, myseIf.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.72,1:21:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很可爱 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute little nippers, ain't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.95,1:21:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信这些将来有可能变成皮包的是孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose those potential overnight bags are orphans?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.36,1:21:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们还有爸爸妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. We have some moms and dads as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.10,1:21:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 有好几千只\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, quite a few thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.95,1:21:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最喜欢的部份 喂食时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the part I like best, feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.98,1:21:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那是全程的最高峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect the highlight of the tour.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.07,1:22:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些宝贝活了200年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of these babies live to be 200 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.91,1:22:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那边那一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.42,1:22:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是鳄鱼 从圆鼻子能看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an alligator. You can always tell by its round nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.35,1:22:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是老艾柏！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha! There's old Albert.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.26,1:22:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是条鳄鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he's a croc.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.39,1:22:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次不小心 它咬掉我整只手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got overcareless with him sometime back and he took my whole arm off.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.23,1:22:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好 艾柏！- 它们什么都吃 甚至同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well done, Albert. - They'll eat anything, even each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.30,1:22:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 它们整年不吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again, sometime they can go a whole year without eating.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.94,1:22:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我宁愿等那一刻 - 有两种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I was rather counting on that. - There are two ways…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.41,1:22:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让鳄鱼伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to disable a crocodile, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.62,1:22:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你不会跟我分享这种消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you care to share that information with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.62,1:23:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个办法是拿笔戳它的双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way is to take a pencil and jam it in the depression hold behind his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.19,1:23:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.36,1:23:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个更简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the other is twice as simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.97,1:23:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要把手放在它嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just put your hand in his mouth…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.44,1:23:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它的牙齿拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and pull his teeth out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.44,1:25:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,失火了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.71,1:26:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 抓住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.95,1:26:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,用车阻止他！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, get the car! Cut him off! Hector, move, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.13,1:26:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德抢走一艘船 驶往爱雨兰滩头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond ripped off one of our boats! He's headed for the lrish Bayou.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.30,1:26:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到他的人才能活\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man that gets him stays alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.44,1:26:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, move, you mother…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.47,1:27:41.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎到路易斯安那）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.14,1:27:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,托比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toby!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.21,1:27:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现超速驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toby, I got me a regular Ben Hur down here…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.85,1:27:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,时速95英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…doing 95 minimum.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.85,1:27:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要人手帮忙吗？- 不需要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Need any help, J.W.? - Hell, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.63,1:28:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一辆会超速的车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a set of wheeIs that just won't quit, boy…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.90,1:28:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你的车的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if they's yours, that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.53,1:28:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过去 小子 双手放在车头盖上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spin around, boy. Ten fingers on the fender.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.57,1:28:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legs apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.84,1:28:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你今天运气不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure this ain't exactly your debut with this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.92,1:29:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑错道路开快车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked the wrong parish to haul ass through, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.59,1:29:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能逃得过比柏警长的追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody cuts and runs on Sheriff J.W. Pepper…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.43,1:29:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是他在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it's him speaking now, by the by.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.24,1:29:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fu…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.27,1:29:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你处理完那辆违规车之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.W., soon as you nail that offending vehicle…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.27,1:29:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森小姐打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Miss Pearson just called.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.01,1:29:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的狗口吐白沫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems her dog's foaming all at the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.58,1:30:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把它关在木屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got him locked up in the shed…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.01,1:30:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你是否愿意过去找她 杀了那条徇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wondering if you'd like to come over and shoot it for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.25,1:30:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉泰森小姐 去做梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell Miss Pearson take a flying Dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.69,1:30:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有一艘船卡在警长的车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That look like a boat stuck in the sheriff's car there, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.63,1:30:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这辈子到哪去了？那是最新型的车船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, where you been all your life? That there's one of them new car-boats.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.20,1:30:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个警区\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the powers invested in me…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.97,1:30:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,赋予我的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by this parish…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.47,1:30:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令此辆车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I hereby do commandeer this vehicle…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.64,1:30:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和里面所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and all those persons within.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.28,1:30:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你们两位 痞子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means you, smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.90,1:32:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,23号就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 23 in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.23,1:32:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答 23号呼叫28号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten-four, 23. Come in, 28.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.67,1:32:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像迪克罗杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, J.W., seems like Deke Rogers…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.40,1:32:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的船在岸边被偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…done got his boat stole off the river…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.84,1:32:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在他游泳池找到一艘新船\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but picked up a new one in his swimming pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.01,1:32:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 你要我让你的人不要听这个频道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, you want to get your boys off our frequency?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.75,1:32:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我！听我说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that! Now you listen to me, trooper boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.12,1:32:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有群黑小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a swamp full of black Russians…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.99,1:32:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,意图扰乱治安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…driving boats to beat the band down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.85,1:32:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 警长 我们在术勒桥处安排了路障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Sheriff. We've got a roadblock waiting for them at Miller's Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.56,1:32:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,26号车在米勒桥 我们就快准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 26 at Miller's Bridge. We're just about all set here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.86,1:32:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要确定那边百密不疏 听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that secure there, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.84,1:32:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fellas, here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.52,1:32:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！我负责这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, out of my way! I'm in charge here!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.42,1:32:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两位 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two boys, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.63,1:33:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要听理由 我要那两个人和他们的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want excuses. I want those two men and their boats…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.00,1:33:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 立刻被逮捕 - 是 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- apprehended immediately, did you hear? - Yes, sir, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.60,1:33:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解 但我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand. But I don't know right off…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.77,1:33:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪可以找比他们还快的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where we'll find a boat fast enough to catch them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.24,1:33:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有主意了 你通知我姊夫 比利包德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. You call my brother-in-law Billy Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.68,1:33:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有最快的飞艇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got the fastest boat on the whole damn river!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.21,1:33:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会修理他们 不是吗？打给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Bob will sure enough fix their ass, huh? Yeah, call Billy Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.79,1:33:30.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（州立野生动物部门 牧场站1号）
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.86,1:33:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利包德 有两艘船开得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's two boats, Billy Bob, and they're moving like buttered pigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.56,1:33:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向他们保证 你抓得到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I promised these boys here you would get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.97,1:33:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别让我失望 知道吗？- 冷静点 我就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't let me down, hear? - Cool down, J.W. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.64,1:33:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要什么吗？- 我想借船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want something, boy? - I'd like to borrow this boat, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.47,1:33:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,整条河的人都想借船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody on the river would like to borrow this boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.01,1:33:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Bob, we got them spotted.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.02,1:33:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝哈利的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're headed for Haley's Landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.73,1:34:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我姊夫比利包德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my brother-in-law! That's Billy Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.47,1:34:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会逮住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get them. Billy Bob'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.64,1:34:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.27,1:34:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果包德家族之一逮不住他们 其他家族会逮住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one side of the Pepper family don't get them, the other side will.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.88,1:34:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.27,1:35:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人能找出正当理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any man can show just cause…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.11,1:35:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能现在结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why they may not lawfully be joined together…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.34,1:35:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说出来 否则此后永远…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let him now speak, or eIse hereafter and forever…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.47,1:35:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部通知各单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headquarters to all units, suspects seen…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.07,1:36:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌犯通过自由角朝11号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}…proceeding down via Liberty towards Highway 11.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.24,1:36:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨慎接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.21,1:36:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那辆破车离开道路 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you get that chicken coop off the road?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.02,1:36:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想申请一张驾照？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever think of getting a driver's license, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.40,1:37:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定他是你姊夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure that was your brother-in-law, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.58,1:39:01.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（让乘船成为有趣的娱乐 时速3英里）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.11,1:39:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菲力 你在这干嘛？- 等下再告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Felix. What are you doing here? - We'll get to that later.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.34,1:39:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,康乃克带着你的女友在城里 他们刚离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}kananga's in town. He's got your girl with him. They just took off.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.02,1:39:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个王八！我抓住他们了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the son of a bitch! I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.59,1:39:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.66,1:39:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日机器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of doomsday machine, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.33,1:39:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们监牢可以关得住你这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got a cage strong enough to hold an animal like you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.77,1:39:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请你向警长说明 好么？- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you enlighten the sheriff? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.27,1:39:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,JW让我跟你私下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.W., let me have a word with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.71,1:39:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,JW这位仁兄从英国来\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.W., now, this fella's from London, England.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.04,1:40:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是名英国人 和我们工作人员合作…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an Englishman working in cooperation with our boys…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.98,1:40:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是秘密情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sort of secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.98,1:40:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密情报员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret agent?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.82,1:40:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On whose side?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.92,1:40:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一小时前搜查了灵魂之最酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}We busted the Fillet of Soul an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.29,1:40:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只找到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came up with nothing but these.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.23,1:40:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没逮捕到康乃克 你应该见见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}kananga's clear. You should have seen…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.40,1:40:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他一起上船那个家伙的体型\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the size of the guy who got on the boat with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.63,1:40:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓有9尺高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine feet tall, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.63,1:40:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大宽帽 一手拿著可笑的笛子 另一手抓著索丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big top hat, a cockamamie flute in one hand and Solitaire in the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.04,1:40:27.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（月亮 死亡）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.20,1:40:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃烧炸弹定在午夜爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The incendiary bombs are set for midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.20,1:41:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好给你三十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that gives you exactly 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.08,1:41:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来时小心鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for sharks on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.55,1:41:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早餐见 菲力 - 狩猎愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see you for breakfast, Felix. - Good hunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.43,1:41:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来时会需要这个 还有鲨鱼枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to need these and the shark gun on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.21,1:41:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派对好像开始了 - 替我向沙特蝶男爵问好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seems like the party's started. - My regards to Baron Samedi…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.28,1:41:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在两眼之问\N{\fnArial\fs30}…right between the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.09,1:48:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,出问题了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.49,1:49:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你来了！索丽塔小姐也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Bond, there you are! And Miss Solitaire, as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.80,1:49:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然是不速之客 仍然欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly unexpected, but most welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.10,1:49:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,惠士勃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whisper!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.27,1:49:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再拿两个玻璃杯给我们的贵宾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more glasses for our guests!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.44,1:49:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们为何而喝？- 地震如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What shall we drink to, Mr. Bond? - Well, how about an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.79,1:49:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回家！我们的那小子呢？- 随时会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome home! Where's our boy? - He'll be along anytime now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.92,1:49:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查过石头底下 他的潜水衣不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked behind a rock, and his wet suit is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.26,1:49:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,零钱不用找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}k eep the change.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.80,1:49:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸的 你的潜水衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unfortunate that your wet suit was discovered…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.90,1:49:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在田地被摧毁前找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…only minutes before the field was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.97,1:49:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说你没保险 - 没有 罂栗花是很娇贵的花朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't tell me you're not insured. - No. The poppy's a very sturdy flower.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.41,1:50:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都是捣蛋鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been a relatively minor nuisance, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.98,1:50:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把枪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this gun…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.18,1:50:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现它特别吸引人 是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it particularly fascinating. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.42,1:50:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼枪 一把气枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shark gun, naturally, with compressed gas pellets.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.65,1:50:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才之作！\N{\fnArial\fs30}lngenious!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.05,1:50:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把针拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pull the pin out.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.85,1:50:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的空气已经够臭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The air in here is foul enough already.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.89,1:50:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到你还是输不起的输家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! Somehow I never thought of you as a poor loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.86,1:50:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来希望和你一起敬未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you would join me to a drink to the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.53,1:50:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,索丽塔小姐以前都知道未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Solitaire used to know all about the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.56,1:50:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对预测死亡特别拿手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was especially good at predicting death.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.00,1:50:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条地下铁路\N{\fnArial\fs30}An underground monorail.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.74,1:51:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你最后的老巢相接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connected to the last refuge of a scoundrel, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.18,1:51:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想海洛因是从这里由绞车运走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heroin leaves here, I take it, carried somewhere by that winch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.55,1:51:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 邦德先生 你学得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct again, Mr. Bond. What a quick study you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.52,1:51:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我示范究竟是怎么启动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you exactly how it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.45,1:51:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那位仁兄到底去哪儿？- 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where in hell can the man be? - Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.96,1:51:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有事耽误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have got tied up somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.49,1:51:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个箱子载重25磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}These cans hold 25 pounds each.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.56,1:51:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共要运20箱 由水路运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 20 cans to a shipment, packed in watertight…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.67,1:51:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,金属装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}…metal containers.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.61,1:51:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,少夸张了 我想有更快淹死人的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your show, but I'm sure there must be a simpler way of drowning someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.64,1:51:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,淹死 我不相信你有机会被淹死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drown, Mr. Bond? I doubt you'll get the chance to drown.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.99,1:52:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以试简单的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we could try something in an even simpler vein.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.56,1:52:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反的 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.56,1:52:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些伤口很要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find those wounds quite fatal.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.10,1:53:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,惠士勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whisper.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.18,1:53:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.98,1:53:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 惠士勃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, slowly, Whisper! Slowly, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.72,1:53:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合用餐者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let our diners assemble.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.26,1:54:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.79,1:55:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 康乃克到哪去 - 他总有一套…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's kananga? - Well, he always did have…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.33,1:55:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我膨胀的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an inflated opinion of himseIf.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.84,1:55:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.47,1:55:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.14,1:55:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是搭火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take the train, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.01,1:55:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你今晚做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything, Felix. I'll see you tomorrow night…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.08,1:55:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天晚上九点在21俱乐部见 别迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything, Felix. I'll see you tomorrow night at the 21 Club. Don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.32,1:55:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍看不出来你为何要这样旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see why you'll travel this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.32,1:55:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在火车上16小时可以做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell can the two of you do on the train for 16 hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.22,1:55:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,向菲力说再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say good-bye to Felix, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.74,1:56:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩「吉拉密」首先是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the first thing to learn in playing gin rummy is to never take…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.87,1:56:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你正需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a card from the exposed pile.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.07,1:56:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿摊在桌上的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you really need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.25,1:56:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gin.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.82,1:56:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.36,1:56:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想证实一个老传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just testing an old adage.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.96,1:56:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸运的一对牌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlucky at cards…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.19,1:56:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 詹姆斯 - 马上就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do hurry up, James. - Won't be a moment, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.59,1:57:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,上床前别忘记锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the door as well on your way up, would you, James?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.49,1:57:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,总而言之 你不会想别人闯进来 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, we wouldn't want anyone to just walk in on us, would we?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.87,1:57:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次我感觉像个完整的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time in my life, I feel like a complete woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.27,1:57:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的手轻微接触…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slightest touch of your hand…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.74,1:57:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕我们分手 会唤起过去不如意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was always so afraid that a part of me would stay with the past…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.21,1:57:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我知道不可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but now I know there's no chance of that any longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.75,1:57:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出去接触你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be able to reach out and touch you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.59,1:58:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 真高兴再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, it's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.78,1:59:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.15,1:59:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？让我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.90,1:59:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 放我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.34,1:59:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that wasn't very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.94,1:59:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.61,2:00:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是解除武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just being disarming, darling.
